              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সতর্ক — sôtôrkô — \"alert; on guard\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "রেডিওতে সবাইকে সতর্ক থাকতে বলল। reḍiote sôbāike sôtôrkô thākte bôllô. The radio told everyone to stay alert."
