          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সতর্ক (sôtôrkô) is Sanskrit satarka, 'with reasoning', and so 'cautious' (Monier-Williams): sa-, 'with', and tarka, 'reasoning' — তর্ক, in Bengali, is an argument."
            }
          ]
        },
