          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সংকেত (sôngket) is Sanskrit saṃketa, 'an agreement, a convention' (Monier-Williams); a storm signal is a sign everyone has agreed to read the same way."
            }
          ]
