              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "এড়ানো — eṛāno — \"to avoid\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আমরা বড় রাস্তা এড়িয়ে গলি দিয়ে গেলাম। āmrā bôṛo rāstā eṛiye gôli diye gelām. We avoided the main road and went through the lanes."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি বিপদ এড়ালেন, tini bipôd eṛālen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "এড়ানো (eṛāno) is filed in CDIAL 2511 under Sanskrit ḗṭatē, 'goes', which lists Bengali eṛāna, 'to avoid', beside eṛā, 'to let go, reject'; how the sense moved is not set out there. The -এ form is এড়িয়ে: এড়িয়ে গেলাম, I steered clear."
            }
          ]
        },
